   "subject": "Re: Dichotomous outcome varibles and missing data",
   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">##  mice_2.22           lattice_0.20-29   semTools_0.4-6      lavaan_0.5-19.863 Amelia_1.7.3 </span></div></code></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>There is a new version of semTools on CRAN (0.4-9), but I don&#39;t know if that has anything to do with your error.  There have been internal changes to lavaan that semTools 0.4-6 did not yet accommodate, and I&#39;m not sure whether runMI was one of the functions affected.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
